{"scene_id": "s01750", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s01750.fountain", "heading": "INT. RADIO HUT - FLOODED RICE PADDY - NIGHT", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "MAJOR WHITCOMBE", "names": ["MAJOR WHITCOMBE", "WHITCOMBE"], "gender": "m", "first": 5, "spoke": 14}, {"id": 1, "name": "SOLDIER", "names": ["SOLDIER"], "gender": "m", "first": 6, "spoke": 3}, {"id": 2, "name": "ODETTE LAMBERT", "names": ["ODETTE LAMBERT", "ODETTE"], "gender": "f", "first": 7, "spoke": 6}, {"id": 3, "name": "TRAN", "names": ["TRAN"], "gender": "?", "first": 12, "spoke": 7}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. RADIO HUT - FLOODED RICE PADDY - NIGHT", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Bamboo walls on stilts above black water.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "A kerosene lamp.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "A field radio on a crate, its dials faintly glowing.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Rain drums the thatch and drips through in three places, into three cooking pots.", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "MAJOR WHITCOMBE (50s, British liaison, damp mustache, an unlit cigar) sits cross-legged on a rolled blanket, a map across his knees.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "At the radio, a SOLDIER (20s, barefoot, helmet at his feet, thin as the bamboo) twists the dial through static.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "In the corner, ODETTE LAMBERT (30s, field nurse, hair cut short as a boy's) wraps bandage around a wounded forearm that is, evidently, her own.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Nothing. Only the ocean.", "name": "SOLDIER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That is not the ocean, son. That is the sound of the Pacific not talking to us.", "name": "WHITCOMBE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Yes, sir.", "name": "SOLDIER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "What is your name?", "name": "WHITCOMBE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Tran, sir.", "name": "SOLDIER", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "First or last?", "name": "WHITCOMBE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Last. My first is Minh.", "name": "TRAN", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Minh Tran. Good. You will be on the radio until dawn, Minh. If anyone answers, you wake me. If no one answers, you wake me anyway.", "name": "WHITCOMBE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Why, sir?", "name": "TRAN", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Because the night is long, and I should like to be told when it ends.", "name": "WHITCOMBE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Odette finishes her bandage and bites the end of the tape.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "She tests the knot.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "It holds.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Major, you might tell him the real reason.", "name": "ODETTE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Which is?", "name": "WHITCOMBE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That we've been cut off for three days, and you want to hear a human voice.", "name": "ODETTE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Madame Lambert, you are insubordinate.", "name": "WHITCOMBE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm a nurse. It's a symptom.", "name": "ODETTE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Of what?", "name": "WHITCOMBE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Of watching men pretend.", "name": "ODETTE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "A drip lands in a pot with a clear, small note.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Tran turns the dial.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "The static rises, falls, rises.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Sir, may I speak?", "name": "TRAN", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You may.", "name": "WHITCOMBE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "My brother is in the north. He's with them.", "name": "TRAN", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "With them.", "name": "WHITCOMBE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "With the other side. I don't know where. If I hear his voice on this radio I don't know what I'll do.", "name": "TRAN", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then you will do what a soldier does. You will wake me.", "name": "WHITCOMBE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And then?", "name": "TRAN", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then we shall see.", "name": "WHITCOMBE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "He means he won't shoot, Minh.", "name": "ODETTE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": ["gently"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I did not say that.", "name": "WHITCOMBE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You didn't have to.", "name": "ODETTE", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "The Major lifts the cigar to his mouth, finds it unlit, lowers it.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "The lamp flickers.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "Tran adjusts one last dial, and for a heartbeat the static thins, and a thread of faint music comes through, a woman singing in a language none of them speaks.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "The three of them listen.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Whatever that is, do not touch it.", "name": "WHITCOMBE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "No, sir.", "name": "TRAN", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "The song fades.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "The rain keeps falling, in three pots, in the dark.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}]}